ー\nhttps://imgur.com/a/IEcpufT\n\nゾムラッド\nhttps://twitter.com/chrone_co/status/1395655495080235009\nhttps://t.co/M6vC5UwKlM\n\nシーンの参照。\nhttps://shoreacres.files.wordpress.com/2021/05/galvstone3.jpg\nhttps://st3.depositphotos.com/9900404/i/600/depositphotos_194088618-stock-photo-ancient-tombstone-or-grave-overgrown.jpg\nhttps://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/2048/cpsprodpb/5255/production/_95477012_hi012049070.jpg\n\nレインフラワーです。\nhttps://images.app.goo.gl/xTtugsYrTXaW5MMf9\n\nポーズの参考。\nhttps://hachibani.tumblr.com/post/173271410220\nhttps://twitter.com/hoppe_illust/status/1376461257503481857\n[7/17] https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/75739664\n\nhttps://virtualyoutuber.fandom.com/wiki/Kureiji_Ollie/Gallery", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@riri08poster/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1468902, "client_id": 258293, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ec8d5c48/uploads/origins/8d25a3e7-8744-4efd-b5ed-4f7ee07ce469?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee2d8a668b13c9b2bc1bacf23de8ba56", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ec8d5c48/uploads/origins/8d25a3e7-8744-4efd-b5ed-4f7ee07ce469?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee2d8a668b13c9b2bc1bacf23de8ba56, https://si.imgix.net/ec8d5c48/uploads/origins/8d25a3e7-8744-4efd-b5ed-4f7ee07ce469?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a2b7bd3c772d5216f301e9a6292d8370 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ec8d5c48/uploads/origins/8d25a3e7-8744-4efd-b5ed-4f7ee07ce469?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac68200907c89b999cc381dcd8498d6f 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ec8d5c48/uploads/origins/8d25a3e7-8744-4efd-b5ed-4f7ee07ce469?bg=%23fff&auto=form